When the user asks for UI/UX patterns, design references, or how real apps implement a flow (onboarding, checkout, settings, empty states, dashboards, tables), load and follow the canonical skill:

`~/.cursor/skills/ui-pattern-research/SKILL.md`

Search Mobbin, write a pattern brief, and apply it only to the requested gap. Do not invent production examples from memory, and do not restyle a local-app mock to match a reference app.
